# set backed up somewhere private (see challenges/README.md).
challenges/*
!challenges/README.md

# Binaries are never committed, wherever they end up
*.elf
*.out
*.exe
*.so
*.o

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local agent conventions, not published
CLAUDE.md
